---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import ClosingCTA from '../components/ClosingCTA.astro';
import { projectPricingNote, services } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Web Development, Software & Automation | Rohit Kumar" description="Websites to generate leads, custom software and SaaS, APIs, and business automations to cut repeat work. Custom projects start at $599.">
  <section class="inner-hero service-hero page-shell"><p class="section-kicker" data-reveal>Solutions / What I build</p><div class="inner-hero-line"><h1 data-reveal>What’s getting in the way?<br /><em>Let’s fix it.</em></h1><p data-reveal>I build lead-focused websites, custom software and SaaS, APIs, and automations to help you get more customers, save time, and solve the problems slowing your business down.</p></div><div class="service-artwork" data-reveal aria-hidden="true"><div class="service-art-glow"></div><div class="service-art-core"><span>PROBLEM</span><i>✳</i><span>BUILT WITH</span><b>PURPOSE</b></div><div class="service-art-ring ring-a"></div><div class="service-art-ring ring-b"></div><div class="service-art-tag tag-a">AI + MODERN TOOLS</div><div class="service-art-tag tag-b">BUILT AROUND YOUR BUSINESS</div></div></section>
  <section class="services-detail page-shell"><div class="service-detail-intro" data-reveal><p class="section-kicker"><span>01</span> What I can build</p><h2>Tools that fit<br /><em>the way you work.</em></h2><p>Maybe you need a website that brings in more leads, custom software or SaaS that replaces a clunky process, or an automation that saves hours. Tell me what’s not working, and I’ll help find a good way to fix it.</p></div><div class="service-detail-list">{services.map((service) => <article class="service-detail-row" data-reveal><span>{service.index}</span><div><h3>{service.title}</h3><p>{service.text}</p></div><b>{service.mark}</b></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="process-section page-shell"><div class="section-heading" data-reveal><div><p class="section-kicker"><span>02</span> The process</p><h2>From first conversation<br /><em>to launch.</em></h2></div><p class="process-note">First, we agree on the problem and what a better result looks like. Then I plan the build and keep you updated along the way.</p></div><ol class="process-list"><li data-reveal><span>01</span><div><h3>Find what’s not working</h3><p>We look for missed leads, slow tasks, or anything getting in the way of growth.</p></div><b>↘</b></li><li data-reveal><span>02</span><div><h3>Agree on the goal</h3><p>We get clear on what needs to improve, the budget, and the timeline.</p></div><b>↘</b></li><li data-reveal><span>03</span><div><h3>Build and test</h3><p>I share progress and make changes based on your feedback.</p></div><b>↘</b></li><li data-reveal><span>04</span><div><h3>Get it ready to launch</h3><p>I prepare the build for your team and customers, then help plan what comes next.</p></div><b>↗</b></li></ol></section>
  <section class="pricing-feature page-shell"><div class="pricing-aside" data-reveal><p class="section-kicker"><span>03</span> Pricing</p><p>One project.<br />One clear plan.</p></div><div class="pricing-main" data-reveal><span class="pricing-label">CUSTOM DEVELOPMENT</span><p class="price-display"><sup>FROM</sup><strong>$599</strong><span>USD</span></p><p>{projectPricingNote}</p><ul><li><Icon name="check" /> Scope and plan based on your goal</li><li><Icon name="check" /> Custom design, software, or automation build</li><li><Icon name="check" /> Testing, launch setup, and handoff</li></ul><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Tell me what you need <Icon name="arrow" /></a></div><div class="pricing-stamp" aria-hidden="true">NO<br />ONE-SIZE<br />TEMPLATE</div></section>
  <section class="services-faq page-shell" aria-labelledby="services-faq-title"><div class="section-heading" data-reveal><div><p class="section-kicker"><span>04</span> Before we start</p><h2 id="services-faq-title">A few things<br /><em>to know.</em></h2></div><p>Every project is different. I’ll confirm the scope, price, and timeline with you before work begins.</p></div><div class="services-faq-list">
    <details data-reveal><summary>What does the $599 starting price include?</summary><p>$599 is the minimum starting price. What’s included depends on your project. After we discuss the goal and scope, I’ll send you a clear price, timeline, and list of deliverables before you decide.</p></details>
    <details data-reveal><summary>How long does a project take?</summary><p>The schedule depends on the size of the build and how quickly we can review decisions and content. I’ll give you a timeline with the project scope before we start.</p></details>
    <details data-reveal><summary>Can you improve something I already use?</summary><p>Yes. I can look at an existing website, software tool, API, or repeat process and suggest a practical way to improve it.</p></details>
    <details data-reveal><summary>Can you guarantee more leads or sales?</summary><p>No one can honestly guarantee a specific business result from a build alone. I can make the website and lead capture clearer, or reduce repeat work with software and automation, but results also depend on your offer, customers, and how the solution is used.</p></details>
  </div></section>
  <ClosingCTA number="05" />
</BaseLayout>
